<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-card" wx:if="{{profile}}">
    <view class="title">实名认证</view>
    <view class="sub-title">请补充真实姓名和身份证信息，完成身份认证。</view>
    <view class="chip-row">
      <view class="tag-chip {{profile.verified ? 'tag-success' : 'tag-warning'}}">{{profile.displayVerifiedStatus}}</view>
      <view class="tag-chip tag-default">{{profile.displayRole}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">认证信息</view>
    <view class="surface" wx:if="{{profile}}">
      <sensitive-field
        label="真实姓名"
        value="{{form.realName}}"
        masked-value="{{profile.displayRealName}}"
        visible="{{visibility.realName}}"
        empty-text="未认证"
        data-field="realName"
        bind:toggle="toggleSensitive"
      />
      <sensitive-field
        label="身份证号"
        value="{{form.idCardNo}}"
        masked-value="{{profile.maskedIdCardNo}}"
        visible="{{visibility.idCardNo}}"
        empty-text="未填写"
        data-field="idCardNo"
        bind:toggle="toggleSensitive"
      />
    </view>
    <input
      class="input"
      placeholder="请输入真实姓名"
      value="{{form.realName}}"
      data-field="realName"
      bindinput="onInput"
    />
    <input
      class="input"
      placeholder="请输入身份证号"
      value="{{form.idCardNo}}"
      data-field="idCardNo"
      bindinput="onInput"
    />
    <view class="accent-note">
      认证完成后可查看志愿者号，无需手动填写。
    </view>
    <view class="accent-note" wx:if="{{profile && profile.maskedVolunteerCardNo}}">
      当前志愿者号：{{profile.maskedVolunteerCardNo}}
    </view>
    <view class="accent-note">
      完成认证后，志愿者、管理员和超级管理员都可以继续执行各自的关键操作。
    </view>
    <view class="button-row">
      <button class="native-btn primary" bindtap="submit">提交认证</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
